第4周、第8周和第12周。主要分析集为全分析集，主要终点分析采用协方差分析方法并以基线NT-proBNP为协变量进行校正，同时检验三个剂量组与安慰剂组之间的剂量-反应趋势。","rationale":"本章节正文依据项目已确认的主要终点定义（第12周NT-proBNP较基线百分比变化、双盲期）、评价时间点（基线、第4/8/12周）、三个剂量水平（2.5/5/10 mg qd）、主要分析集（FAS）及统计方法（ANCOVA基线校正、剂量-反应趋势检验）撰写。剂量-反应趋势检验为项目已确认的统计分析策略组成部分。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（主要目的和主要终点）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_4e9f04592c63_16cfca56a149f303","section_number":"3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:663a0de3f9a54d465344dd99","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a1616fe22868fa","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:665025df83658b"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"0a6ce518f3f9ca7935aa3dfb142b08f10d3ad3098e51c10c03db2ae50a4fdada","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_4e9f04592c63_2c493b849da84a70:full-draft:663a0de3f9a54d465344dd99","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:663a0de3f9a54d465344dd99","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:c6db057129385f4569bbfa293ad2e538ea037252b306813884be18a9e30894a1:663a0de3f9a54d465344dd99","text_sha256":"0a6ce518f3f9ca7935aa3dfb142b08f10d3ad3098e51c10c03db2ae50a4fdada"},{"content_sha256":"c325e9817d1cf579e7ab57b2e407e0c0773a11b3252a3cf3fee19ef3e195636f","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:revision:6","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","text_sha256":"